OL,3,GNEWSAFalkirk's Cladhan Hotel closes
OL,4,Apermanently to asylum seekers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hotel in Falkirk which was previously
OL,7,Fused to house asylum seekers has been
OL,8,Fclosed and handed back to the
OL,9,Fcommunity, the Home Office has
OL,10,Fconfirmed.
OL,12,FThe Cladhan was the site of several
OL,13,Fdemonstrations last summer involving
OL,14,Fpro and anti-immigration demonstrators.
OL,16,FIt is understood the hotel, on the
OL,17,Ftown's Kemper Avenue, has not been used
OL,18,Ffor accommodating asylum seekers since
OL,19,FAugust.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
